            <link>https://haynoi.com</link>
            <sparkle:version>22</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Haynoi 0.3.1</h2>

<h3>Changed</h3>
<ul>
<li>Haynoi re-checks its network routes whenever your connection changes</li>
</ul>
<p>  (new Wi-Fi, VPN on/off, waking up somewhere else) — not just at</p>
<p>  launch. Long-running sessions always dictate over the current best</p>
<p>  route.</p>
<p><a href="https://github.com/sonpiaz/haynoi/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md">View full changelog</a></p>
]]></description>
